":"git_write","bundle":"tools","safe":false,"impl":true,"desc":"**版本库写面**（只两个 op，且**永远要点名路径**）：stage（`git add -- <paths>`）· commit（**p","files":["gbt_allinone/tools/__init__.py"],"file":"gbt_allinone/tools/__init__.py"},{"id":"projection_card","bundle":"tools","safe":true,"impl":true,"desc":"空间投射只读卡片：5 原语全标未核实 + ARM ≠ LIVE 红线（只呈现不执行）","files":["gbt_allinone/tools/__init__.py"],"file":"gbt_allinone/tools/__init__.py"},{"id":"devour_fusion","bundle":"devour","safe":true,"impl":true,"desc":"吞天 × 原生能力 融合台账（主人令「把蒸馏提炼出契合自己的原生能力和吞天融合到一起…以及记入能力」）：吞进来的东西**三件齐才算融合** ","files":["gbt_allinone/tools/__init__.py"],"file":"gbt_allinone/tools/__init__.py"},{"id":"devour_github","bundle":"devour","safe":true,"impl":true,"desc":"吞天：吞噬 GitHub 仓库为知识胶囊（自我进化的核心——吸收外部能力）","files":["gbt_allinone/devour.py"],"file":"gbt_allinone/devour.py"},{"id":"devour_pulse","bundle":"devour","safe":true,"impl":true,"desc":"吞天：完整认知循环（吞噬→反思→消化→重组→进化）","files":["gbt_allinone/devour.py"],"file":"gbt_allinone/devour.py"},{"id":"devour_reflect","bundle":"devour","safe":true,"impl":true,"desc":"吞天：反思（回顾吞噬历史学习模式，发现弱能力与重组机会）","files":["gbt_allinone/devour.py"],"file":"gbt_allinone/devour.py"},{"id":"devour_scan","bundle":"devour","safe":true,"impl":true,"desc":"吞天：能力缺口扫描（域覆盖对照+进化方向）","files":["gbt_allinone/devour.py"],"file":"gbt_allinone/devour.py"},{"id":"cli_agent_hub","bundle":"integration","safe":true,"impl":true,"desc":"外部 CLI 编程助手**集成面**（只读面+写门）：把 GenOffice「集成」面板蒸馏进框架本体 —— 一张表列全 **6 位**外部","files":["gbt_allinone/__init__.py"],"file":"gbt_allinone/__init__.py"},{"id":"cli_chat","bundle":"integration","safe":false,"impl":true,"desc":"外部 CLI 助手**对话面板**（把「集成」面板真的接到对话上）：`agents` 只读底表（装没装/版本/**能不能一次性驱动**/一次","files":["gbt_allinone/__init__.py"],"file":"gbt_allinone/__init__.py"},{"id":"feishu_embed","bundle":"integration","safe":true,"impl":true,"desc":"飞书镶嵌窗口（只读骨架·门）：面板卡⑥，**走浏览器触手不用 API**；四条红线（飞书是副本本地是源/凭据不许明文/不绕验证/每次操作留痕","files":["gbt_allinone/tools/__init__.py"],"file":"gbt_allinone/tools/__init__.py"},{"id